## D1 — one source of truth

`l4Taxonomy()` (`tools/ai-autonomy.php:26`) is now the single list. Every entry is `{reason, class, decidable, matchers}`; judgement-based entries are present with `decidable:false, matchers:[]` so the printed/enforced gap is explicit. `absoluteProhibitions()` / `contractRelativeTriggers()` / `l4Triggers()` are pure projections, and enforcement calls the taxonomy through `sensitiveMatches()` → `sensitiveReasons()`. Counts unchanged: `absolute_prohibitions`=5, `contract_relative_l4`=10.

## D2 — safety floor

Absolute prohibitions are enforced **before** grounding, regardless of `allowed_scope`:
- existing test files (`tests/**/*_test.php`, `modules/*/tests/**/*.php`) — existence-decidable: a **new** test file is an addition and still proceeds;
- gate config (`phpstan.neon`, `.github/workflows/**`, plus phpunit/phpcs/playwright/cs-fixer/rector/infection configs);
- baseline `phpstan-baseline.neon`;
- authority/security paths.

## D3 — `stop-report`

`php tools/ai-autonomy.php stop-report --remaining=N [--stop-reason=TYPE] [--json]`, exit codes documented in `usage()` and in the standing contract runbook. It prints the invariant, the count, and `LEGITIMATE_STOP`/`ILLEGITIMATE_STOP`.

## D4 — policy

`presumptive authority` now appears at `.github/instructions/ai-autonomy-escalation.instructions.md:51`, and `stop-report` is named as the mechanical expression of the stop invariant (line 43).

## D7/D8 — envelope defects visible, not fatal

`plan` computes `warnings` (also exposed in `--json` as a `warnings` list) for: no `harness:` block referencing the standing contract, forbidden bullets the parser cannot bind to a path (naming each dropped line), and any allowed/forbidden intersection (naming both entries). Exit codes unchanged; `check` remains fail-closed.

> **Honest note on D8's "measured on this very contract":** the contract file on disk now contains **6** `Forbidden changes` bullets, all path-decidable, and `.ai/*.contract.md` appears only in prose (D8 text and Architectural constraints) — so the two original defects are not currently reproducible on it. The mechanic is implemented and tested against fixtures that reproduce the exact original defects.

